{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1434024-new-fokuf-lore","id":1434024,"title":"New Fokuf lore?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-01-31T11:18:30-08:00","id":1434024,"title":"New Fokuf lore?","content":"Did Fokuf ever get any new lore in 3rd Ed? He was my favorite mortal who might secretly be an Exalted (like a Fiend Caste) and I am curious if he ever got any new updates.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-31T11:21:58-08:00","id":1434025,"title":"","content":"Nope, bit of clarification that he's pretty much an unambitious waste of blood that no one aside from him would be upset about if the Empress came back and obliterated him for being in her chair. And that he's fully aware and content with being a rubber stamp, implied in part because the rest of the Dynasty's governing body can't agree to such an extent that he doesn't have to do anything. (Presumably to get away from the idea a number of people had that he was secretly a political mastermind manipulating shit in secret.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-31T11:36:45-08:00","id":1434026,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't say he's content so much as aware of how expendable he is.<br /> <br /> If you wanted him to Exalt, he's got enough personality to have a &quot;NO MORE!&quot; moment where he refuses to sign something that'll deal the deathblow to House Tepet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-31T11:40:16-08:00","id":1434027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1434024-new-fokuf-lore?p=1434026#post1434026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wouldn't say he's content so much as aware of how expendable he is.<br /> <br /> If you wanted him to Exalt, he's got enough personality to have a &quot;NO MORE!&quot; moment where he refuses to sign something that'll deal the deathblow to House Tepet.</div> </div> </div> </div>A good idea, but I still have a hint of green fever after all these years and want to see him as a Fiend. So instead, he had a moment where he could have stepped up and done some real good, but flinched from the risks. The Ebon Dragon sees he could be useful and that he now has a chip on his shoulder, and BAM, he becomes a fiend. Fokuf was practically made to wield Witness to Darkness, in that he is inherently unlikable.<br /> <br /> Edit: Or have things changed for Infernals so that they aren\u2019t all haunted by some great failure now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-31T12:13:13-08:00","id":1434028,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1434024-new-fokuf-lore?p=1434027#post1434027\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit: Or have things changed for Infernals so that they aren\u2019t all haunted by some great failure now?</div> </div> </div> </div>They\u2019re people who\u2019ve been stepped on one too many times instead. Which still works for Fokuf.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-31T13:24:46-08:00","id":1434033,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1434024-new-fokuf-lore?p=1434027#post1434027\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A good idea, but I still have a hint of green fever after all these years and want to see him as a Fiend. So instead, he had a moment where he could have stepped up and done some real good, but flinched from the risks. The Ebon Dragon sees he could be useful and that he now has a chip on his shoulder, and BAM, he becomes a fiend. Fokuf was practically made to wield Witness to Darkness, in that he is inherently unlikable.<br /> <br /> Edit: Or have things changed for Infernals so that they aren\u2019t all haunted by some great failure now?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not only are Infernals no longer Exalted in a moment of failure, but the Fiend Caste no longer exists. All new Castes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-31T15:38:41-08:00","id":143